<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Bank Soal Interaktif Geografi Kelas X (45 Soal)</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-main: #0f172a;
      --bg-card: #1e293b;
      --bg-card-hover: #334155;
      --border-color: #334155;
      --text-main: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --primary: #3b82f6;
      --primary-hover: #2563eb;
      --success: #10b981;
      --success-bg: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --danger-bg: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
      --warning: #f59e0b;
      --accent: #8b5cf6;
      --kisi-color: #38bdf8;
      --pengayaan-color: #a855f7;
      --radius: 12px;
      --shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-main);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding-bottom: 60px;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 24px 20px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .header-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .header-title-box {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .header-title-box h1 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .header-title-box h1 span {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #8b5cf6);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    /* Dashboard Stats Bar */
    .dashboard-bar {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .stat-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .stat-val {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .stat-score { color: var(--warning); }
    .stat-answered { color: var(--primary); }
    .stat-correct { color: var(--success); }
    .stat-wrong { color: var(--danger); }

    .main-layout {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 24px auto;
      padding: 0 16px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .main-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    /* Sidebar controls & Grid Nav */
    .sidebar {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .panel-title {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--text-main);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* Filter Controls */
    .filter-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .filter-label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .filter-buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .btn-filter {
      background: #0f172a;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-filter:hover, .btn-filter.active {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }

    /* Number Grid Navigation */
    .nav-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      max-height: 380px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding-right: 4px;
    }

    .nav-grid::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 5px;
    }
    .nav-grid::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      background: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    .nav-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .nav-btn.answered {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }

    .nav-btn.correct {
      background: var(--success);
      color: white;
      border-color: var(--success);
    }

    .nav-btn.incorrect {
      background: var(--danger);
      color: white;
      border-color: var(--danger);
    }

    .nav-btn.active-current {
      outline: 2px solid white;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    /* Global Action Buttons */
    .action-buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); }

    .btn-success {
      background: var(--success);
      color: white;
    }
    .btn-success:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-main);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    }

    .btn-danger-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: #f87171;
      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-danger-outline:hover {
      background: var(--danger-bg);
    }

    /* Main Content Questions List */
    .content-area {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .question-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
      scroll-margin-top: 140px;
    }

    .question-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
    }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .badges {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .badge {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .badge-number {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .badge-chapter {
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
      color: #c084fc;
      border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
    }

    .badge-kisi {
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
      color: var(--kisi-color);
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
    }

    .badge-pengayaan {
      background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
      color: var(--pengayaan-color);
      border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
    }

    .card-status {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .card-status.correct { color: var(--success); }
    .card-status.incorrect { color: var(--danger); }
    .card-status.answered { color: var(--primary); }
    .card-status.unanswered { color: var(--text-muted); }

    .question-text {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }

    .options-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .option-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .option-item:hover {
      background: #1a233a;
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
    }

    .option-item input[type="radio"] {
      margin-top: 3px;
      accent-color: var(--primary);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .option-key {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
      min-width: 20px;
    }

    .option-text {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
      flex: 1;
    }

    /* Option states after checking */
    .option-item.state-correct {
      background: var(--success-bg) !important;
      border-color: var(--success) !important;
    }
    .option-item.state-correct .option-key,
    .option-item.state-correct .option-text {
      color: #34d399 !important;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .option-item.state-wrong {
      background: var(--danger-bg) !important;
      border-color: var(--danger) !important;
    }
    .option-item.state-wrong .option-key,
    .option-item.state-wrong .option-text {
      color: #f87171 !important;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Card Controls */
    .card-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .card-actions .btn {
      width: auto;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    /* Explanation Box */
    .explanation-box {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-5px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .explanation-title {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .explanation-body {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    /* Summary Modal & Analysis */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      display: none;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 1000;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .modal-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      max-width: 650px;
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 90vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      animation: scaleUp 0.3s ease;
    }

    @keyframes scaleUp {
      from { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0; }
      to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    }

    .modal-title {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .score-circle {
      width: 110px;
      height: 110px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
    }

    .score-circle-num {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .score-circle-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .analysis-section {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .analysis-title {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .chapter-bar-item {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .chapter-bar-label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .progress-bg {
      height: 8px;
      background: #0f172a;
      border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--primary);
      border-radius: 4px;
      transition: width 0.5s ease;
    }

    .empty-state {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Custom Toast Notification */
    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--primary);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      z-index: 2000;
      transform: translateY(100px);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .toast.show {
      transform: translateY(0);
      opacity: 1;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Sticky Header & Dashboard -->
  <header>
    <div class="header-container">
      <div class="header-title-box">
        <h1>🌏 Bank Soal Interaktif <span>Geografi Kelas X</span></h1>
        <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Kurikulum Merdeka (Fase E) • 45 Soal</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Real-Time Score Dashboard -->
      <div class="dashboard-bar">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-val stat-answered" id="stat-answered">0 / 45</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Terjawab</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-val stat-correct" id="stat-correct">0</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Dicek Benar</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-val stat-wrong" id="stat-wrong">0</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Dicek Salah</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-val stat-score" id="stat-score">0.0</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Skalasi Skor (0-100)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Grid Layout -->
  <div class="main-layout">
    
    <!-- Left Sidebar: Controls, Filters & Navigation Grid -->
    <aside class="sidebar">
      
      <!-- Global Actions -->
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-title">⚡ Akses Cepat</div>
        <div class="action-buttons">
          <button class="btn btn-success" onclick="checkAllAnswers()">✓ Cek Semua Jawaban</button>
          <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="shuffleQuestionsAndOptions()">🔀 Acak Soal & Opsi</button>
          <button class="btn btn-danger-outline" onclick="confirmResetAll()">↺ Reset Semua Jawaban</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Filters Panel -->
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-title">🎯 Filter Soal</div>
        <div class="filter-group">
          <div class="filter-label">Kategori Soal</div>
          <div class="filter-buttons">
            <button class="btn-filter active" onclick="setFilter('package', 'all', this)">Semua (45)</button>
            <button class="btn-filter" onclick="setFilter('package', 'kisi', this)">Kisi-Kisi (1-30)</button>
            <button class="btn-filter" onclick="setFilter('package', 'pengayaan', this)">Pengayaan (31-45)</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="filter-group" style="margin-top: 14px;">
          <div class="filter-label">Materi Bab</div>
          <div class="filter-buttons">
            <button class="btn-filter active" onclick="setFilter('chapter', 'all', this)">Semua Bab</button>
            <button class="btn-filter" onclick="setFilter('chapter', 'Dasar Geografi', this)">Dasar Geografi</button>
            <button class="btn-filter" onclick="setFilter('chapter', 'Peta & Pemetaan', this)">Peta & Pemetaan</button>
            <button class="btn-filter" onclick="setFilter('chapter', 'Penginderaan Jauh', this)">Penginderaan Jauh</button>
            <button class="btn-filter" onclick="setFilter('chapter', 'SIG', this)">SIG</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation Grid -->
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-title">
          <span>📌 Lembar Jawab</span>
          <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);" id="grid-count">45 Soal</span>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-grid" id="nav-grid">
          <!-- Dynamically populated 1 to 45 -->
        </div>
      </div>

    </aside>

    <!-- Right Area: Question List Cards -->
    <main class="content-area" id="questions-container">
      <!-- Question Cards dynamically generated -->
    </main>

  </div>

  <!-- Result / Chapter Analysis Modal -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="result-modal">
    <div class="modal-card">
      <div class="modal-title">📊 Hasil & Analisis Penguasaan Materi</div>
      
      <div class="score-circle">
        <div class="score-circle-num" id="modal-score-num">0</div>
        <div class="score-circle-label">NILAI AKHIR</div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--success);" id="modal-correct">0</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Benar</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--danger);" id="modal-wrong">0</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Salah</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted);" id="modal-unanswered">0</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Belum Dijawab</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="analysis-section">
        <div class="analysis-title">Analisis Ketercapaian Per Bab</div>
        <div id="chapter-analysis-list">
          <!-- Dynamically filled chapter progress -->
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 24px; display: flex; gap: 10px;">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="closeModal()">Tutup Modal Analisis</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Toast Notification -->
  <div class="toast" id="toast-msg">Notifikasi</div>

  <!-- JAVASCRIPT LOGIC & COMPLETE DATA -->
  <script>
    // COMPLETE 45 QUESTIONS DATA (100% UNABRIDGED)
    const RAW_QUESTIONS = [
      {
        id: 1,
        chapter: "Dasar Geografi",
        tag: "Kisi-Kisi #1",
        question: "Istilah geografi diperkenalkan pertama kali oleh ilmuwan Yunani Kuno, Eratosthenes, dalam karyanya Geographika. Secara etimologis, gabungan kata geo dan graphein memiliki makna dasar sebagai...",
        options: {
          A: "pencatatan tentang persebaran flora dan fauna",
          B: "penggambaran atau penulisan mengenai bumi",
          C: "pengukuran luas wilayah dan batas administrasi negara",
          D: "pengamatan terhadap pergerakan benda-benda langit",
          E: "penyelidikan tentang struktur batuan penyusun kerak bumi"
        },
        answer: "B",
        explanation: "Secara etimologis dari bahasa Yunani Kuno, 'geo' berarti bumi dan 'graphein' berarti tulisan, lukisan, atau penggambaran. Jadi, geografi bermakna penggambaran atau penulisan mengenai bumi."
      },
      {
        id: 2,
        chapter: "Dasar Geografi",
        tag: "Kisi-Kisi #2",
        question: "Menurut R. Bintarto, geografi merupakan ilmu pengetahuan yang mencitrakan, menerangkan sifat-sifat bumi, menganalisis gejala-gejala alam dan penduduk, serta mempelajari corak yang khas mengenai kehidupan dan berusaha mencari fungsi dari unsur-unsur bumi dalam ruang dan waktu. Berdasarkan definisi tersebut, fokus utama kajian geografi adalah...",
        options: {
          A: "sejarah terbentuknya tata surya dan sistem galaksi",
          B: "proses reaksi kimia dalam pembentukan mineral tambang",
          C: "hubungan timbal balik antara gejala alam dan manusia dalam konteks ruang dan waktu",
          D: "sistem pemerintahan dan hukum adat yang berlaku di suatu negara",
          E: "perkembangan teknologi informasi dalam komunikasi global"
        },
        answer: "C",
        explanation: "Definisi R. Bintarto menekankan pada interaksi dan hubungan timbal balik (sebab-akibat) antara gejala fisik alam dan kehidupan manusia (penduduk) dalam dimensi ruang dan waktu."
      },
      {
        id: 3,
